{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1450962-homebrew-gift-of-the-darkness","id":1450962,"title":"[Homebrew] Gift of the Darkness","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Werewolf: The Forsaken"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-06-04T09:00:26-07:00","id":1450962,"title":"[Homebrew] Gift of the Darkness","content":"I am trying to imagine a Gift of Darkness. I have idea for Cunning, Glory and Purity, but no good idea for Honor and Wisdom. Maybe someone could judge my ideas and propose of their own?<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:20px\"><b>Gift of Darkness (Shadow Gift)</b></span><br /> <br /> <b>In the Shadows (Cunning)</b><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Times\">Prey does not notice you. How it can? You are in the shadow, hidden from the sight, ready to pounce once it averts it's gaze.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Times\"><b>Cost:</b> none</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Times\"><b>Duration:</b> Permanent</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Times\"><b>Effect:</b> The Uratha achieves Exceptional Success on stealth rolls on 3 successes instead of 5, as long as there shadows in the scene he can use to hide.</span></span><br /> <br /> <b>From the Shadows (Glory)</b><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Times\"><b>Cost:</b> 1 Essence</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Times\"><b>Duration:</b> Instant</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Times\"><b>Effect:</b> The Uratha making a surprise attack from darkness; the target may not make a Wits + Composure roll to act normally. Supernatural powers which alert target force Clash of Wills against Primal Urge + Glory.</span></span><br /> <br /> <b>Darkness Overwhelming (Purity)</b><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Times\"><b>Cost:</b> Varies</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Times\"><b>Duration:</b> Permanent</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Times\"><b>Effect:</b> The Uratha gains Influence (Darkness) equal to her dots in Purity. She can use this Influence in the same way as a spirit. Her dice pool for Influence (</span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Times\">Darkness</span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Times\">) rolls is equal to her Manipulation + Occult + Purity.</span></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":11880,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11880-dark-archon","user":"Dark Archon","date":". 11-20-2021, 08:44 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11880-dark-archon","name":"Dark Archon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11880_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"348"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-27T10:41:38-07:00","id":1461714,"title":"","content":"For wisdom I would suggest something about shadows wishpering to the character something the prey is doing or saying at reasonable distance. <br /> For honor I would work on defence stuff, like the character's shadows guiding him in a fight pre-empting enemy's manovuers or something like that. Maybe a honor boost in defence.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#800000\">-'' </span>We are the unsullied.<br /> We are the inheritors.<br /> We are the Pure <span style=\"color:#800000\">''-</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[